# What two wine guides said about the Vallerosa wines in their 2025 editions, one named graph per guide.
# The running example of the RDFSharp manual: https://mdesalvo.github.io/RDFSharp/vallerosa/
# Both guides are fictional. They do not always agree, and neither of them reviewed every wine.

@prefix vr:  <https://vallerosa.example/vocab#> .
@prefix vrd: <https://vallerosa.example/id/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Guida ai Calici, an Italian guide

<https://guidacalici.example/2025> {
    vrd:rosso-2021      vr:score 88 .
    vrd:riserva-2019    vr:score 94 .
    vrd:bianco-2023     vr:score 86 .
    vrd:vinsanto-2015   vr:score 95 .
    vrd:vermentino-2023 vr:score 89 .
}

# WineScope, an international guide

<https://winescope.example/2025> {
    vrd:rosso-2021      vr:score 90 .
    vrd:riserva-2019    vr:score 92 .
    vrd:vinsanto-2015   vr:score 96 .
    vrd:vermentino-2023 vr:score 87 .
    vrd:rosato-2024     vr:score 84 .
}
